(383604, 32324, 10414, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture!  The shadows are a bit dark, but I love how you caught the shine of the croc''s teeth! :)</td>', 'Interesting picture!  The shadows are a bit dark, but I love how you caught the shine of the croc''s teeth! :)', '2003-08-11 01:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(383606, 32888, 10263, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, the colors, the DoF. 8</td>', 'I love the composition, the colors, the DoF. 8', '2003-08-11 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(383607, 32847, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the one window has wire/screen on it.  Adds interest, I think.</td>', 'I like how the one window has wire/screen on it.  Adds interest, I think.', '2003-08-11 01:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(383608, 32311, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite things about this is the blue sky. I can just picture the paint can in the grass outside the house on a clear day, and the satisfaction of seeing the freshly painted trim. (if it''s interior paint and a blue ceiling, never mind ;))</td>', 'One of my favorite things about this is the blue sky. I can just picture the paint can in the grass outside the house on a clear day, and the satisfaction of seeing the freshly painted trim. (if it''s interior paint and a blue ceiling, never mind ;))', '2003-08-11 01:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(383614, 32648, 10643, '<td valign="top">This is cute; the color and the very clear/real paint on the window frame make it a little more realistic than some of the other kids in window pictures. The reflection of the thermometer is unfortunate, distracting slightly from the frustrated expression on the child''s face.</td>', 'This is cute; the color and the very clear/real paint on the window frame make it a little more realistic than some of the other kids in window pictures. The reflection of the thermometer is unfortunate, distracting slightly from the frustrated expression on the child''s face.', '2003-08-11 01:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(383617, 32901, 10414, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clear picture! Even if the picture weren''t this clear, I would stil give you a 9 for creativity! So....9 it is!  :)</td>', 'Very nice, clear picture! Even if the picture weren''t this clear, I would stil give you a 9 for creativity! So....9 it is!  :)', '2003-08-11 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(383618, 32916, 10643, '<td valign="top">This is all in the pose; I like the crop at the bottom where you can see the boy''s leg. He''s clearly trying to climb up on the windowsill in his eagerness to see outside. I remember doing the same thing myself :)</td>', 'This is all in the pose; I like the crop at the bottom where you can see the boy''s leg. He''s clearly trying to climb up on the windowsill in his eagerness to see outside. I remember doing the same thing myself :)', '2003-08-11 01:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(383621, 32859, 10643, '<td valign="top">A great window and a great face. There''s an untold story here, and both the literal and metaphorical meanings of "on the inside looking out" are quite clear. This is a really nice shot.</td>', 'A great window and a great face. There''s an untold story here, and both the literal and metaphorical meanings of "on the inside looking out" are quite clear. This is a really nice shot.', '2003-08-11 01:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(383623, 32691, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool interpretation of the challenge.  I like the overall framing of the shot, but i think seeing more people on the right would make it feel more balanced for me.</td>', 'Cool interpretation of the challenge.  I like the overall framing of the shot, but i think seeing more people on the right would make it feel more balanced for me.', '2003-08-11 01:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(383625, 32918, 10643, '<td valign="top">Reminds me very much of the knothole in "To Kill a Mockingbird." A nice picture, and I like that the bark doesn''t cover the whole frame. The space in the upper left adds some definition.</td>', 'Reminds me very much of the knothole in "To Kill a Mockingbird." A nice picture, and I like that the bark doesn''t cover the whole frame. The space in the upper left adds some definition.', '2003-08-11 01:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(383628, 32912, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the "expression" on his/her face.  Great capture and bw works very well here, I think.</td>', 'I love the "expression" on his/her face.  Great capture and bw works very well here, I think.', '2003-08-11 01:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(383629, 32546, 7969, '<td valign="top">Just a quick thought, may have liked it a little better had the (door frame on) right been cropped out, I think could still tell screen from little lines and title.  I like the cat expression and stand though.</td>', 'Just a quick thought, may have liked it a little better had the (door frame on) right been cropped out, I think could still tell screen from little lines and title.  I like the cat expression and stand though.', '2003-08-11 01:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
