(383944, 32812, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is really very interesting.  I like the composition a lot.  I find myself wondering what sort of place this is?  Is it a home, club, lighting store?  Wierd and intriguing.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is really very interesting.  I like the composition a lot.  I find myself wondering what sort of place this is?  Is it a home, club, lighting store?  Wierd and intriguing.  Nice work.', '2003-08-11 06:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(383948, 32833, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite cat shots so far.  Maybe it''s cause I like the breed, looks like Tonkinese to me perhaps, but I think it''s because of the excellent composition, lighitng, and focus.  Great job.  I''d crop a little more off the left, but who knows, people always tell me to crop differently and I think they''re crazy too!</td>', 'This is one of my favorite cat shots so far.  Maybe it''s cause I like the breed, looks like Tonkinese to me perhaps, but I think it''s because of the excellent composition, lighitng, and focus.  Great job.  I''d crop a little more off the left, but who knows, people always tell me to crop differently and I think they''re crazy too!', '2003-08-11 06:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(383953, 32901, 6349, '<td valign="top">M, this is a good one.  I like the idea a lot.  I actually had an idea to do this back in highschool for a series.  I was actually going to bring my mailbox all over with me and take a bunch of shots out of it.  Later, of course, I realized that it would be better to take a shot of the inside of the mailbox and then photoshop them all together.  You can''t do that for the challenge, so this is just about the best you could do.  The composition is great (I assume you did actually move the mailbox....?)  Would be great if everything was in focus, I think, although this effect works too.  That would be imposible to achieve.</td>', 'M, this is a good one.  I like the idea a lot.  I actually had an idea to do this back in highschool for a series.  I was actually going to bring my mailbox all over with me and take a bunch of shots out of it.  Later, of course, I realized that it would be better to take a shot of the inside of the mailbox and then photoshop them all together.  You can''t do that for the challenge, so this is just about the best you could do.  The composition is great (I assume you did actually move the mailbox....?)  Would be great if everything was in focus, I think, although this effect works too.  That would be imposible to achieve.', '2003-08-11 06:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(383966, 32912, 9849, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Suits black and white very well. I like the way the dog is looking quite sad.<br/> <br/>Good Luck. 10</td>', 'Great shot. Suits black and white very well. I like the way the dog is looking quite sad. Good Luck. 10', '2003-08-11 07:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
