(383996, 32872, 9854, '<td valign="top">Good image, but with the following caveat: the skin is a bit parched and unflattering. Also, there''s a bit of processing artifacts in the dark area of the bottom finger.</td>', 'Good image, but with the following caveat: the skin is a bit parched and unflattering. Also, there''s a bit of processing artifacts in the dark area of the bottom finger.', '2003-08-11 08:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
