(384000, 32891, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the angle used. I don''t know if you had the option to move the dragster, but I''m not to fond about the background.  Mainly because it shows that the dragster is parked on a grass field and is going nowhere. I think a more action-related background (like a tarmac surface with lines on it) would look better.</td>', 'I like the idea and the angle used. I don''t know if you had the option to move the dragster, but I''m not to fond about the background.  Mainly because it shows that the dragster is parked on a grass field and is going nowhere. I think a more action-related background (like a tarmac surface with lines on it) would look better.', '2003-08-11 08:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(384004, 32594, 342, '<td valign="top">I like your title, and now the question is 1 or 10. ....<br/>or something in between</td>', 'I like your title, and now the question is 1 or 10. ....or something in between', '2003-08-11 08:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(384005, 32912, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is just so nice, so very nice.  Such a puppy face!  He wants to come outside and play.  This could benefit from a slightly different composition.  I know that''s asking a lot for a shot like this because it''s the dog face that makes it.  It''s just that the window panes seem a bit unbalanced compositionally.  Maybe even just cropping it all down to the one window pane would help.  8</td>', 'This is just so nice, so very nice.  Such a puppy face!  He wants to come outside and play.  This could benefit from a slightly different composition.  I know that''s asking a lot for a shot like this because it''s the dog face that makes it.  It''s just that the window panes seem a bit unbalanced compositionally.  Maybe even just cropping it all down to the one window pane would help.  8', '2003-08-11 08:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(384008, 32829, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a truly lovely shot and I am sure the models will love it (I assume they are really mother and son and I want to assume that they are your wife and son, but i don''t want to be assuming too much ).  It''s wonderfully beautiful and the soft focus fits prefectly.  It is also a unique take on the challenge.  I can see the inner emotion of love really coming out in the scene.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a truly lovely shot and I am sure the models will love it (I assume they are really mother and son and I want to assume that they are your wife and son, but i don''t want to be assuming too much ).  It''s wonderfully beautiful and the soft focus fits prefectly.  It is also a unique take on the challenge.  I can see the inner emotion of love really coming out in the scene.  Great job.', '2003-08-11 08:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(384010, 32890, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Awesome for the challenge too.  Hope this gets a ribbon.  This would look really great in color (or colored in PS if it was washed out to begin with).  I can imagine it very vibrant with a perfectly blue sky and red and yellow bars and stuff.  This rocks.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Awesome for the challenge too.  Hope this gets a ribbon.  This would look really great in color (or colored in PS if it was washed out to begin with).  I can imagine it very vibrant with a perfectly blue sky and red and yellow bars and stuff.  This rocks.', '2003-08-11 08:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384012, 32915, 6349, '<td valign="top">I find this photo mysterious and appealing.  I keep coming back to it and raising the score.  Great work.  I like the lines, contrasts, lighting, and perfect imperfections of the whole thing.</td>', 'I find this photo mysterious and appealing.  I keep coming back to it and raising the score.  Great work.  I like the lines, contrasts, lighting, and perfect imperfections of the whole thing.', '2003-08-11 08:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(384013, 32272, 6349, '<td valign="top">great image.  One of my favorites.  This is really well lit and exposed.  I''m impressed with how clearly you managed to show the spiderweb.  The sepia is a nice choice as well.</td>', 'great image.  One of my favorites.  This is really well lit and exposed.  I''m impressed with how clearly you managed to show the spiderweb.  The sepia is a nice choice as well.', '2003-08-11 08:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
