(384157, 32874, 6624, '<td valign="top">I think that perhaps the large leaves lower right (elephant ear?)  could have been cropped a bit more toallow for the textures of the cat and the flowers to balance each other and "finish"  the angle of the shot</td>', 'I think that perhaps the large leaves lower right (elephant ear?)  could have been cropped a bit more toallow for the textures of the cat and the flowers to balance each other and "finish"  the angle of the shot', '2003-08-11 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(384160, 32918, 6624, '<td valign="top">like the textures and I am not "sold"  on the fingers although they create great interest with their shadow<br/>nice response to challenge</td>', 'like the textures and I am not "sold"  on the fingers although they create great interest with their shadownice response to challenge', '2003-08-11 10:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(384161, 32775, 6624, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and colors in this and the composition is nice...not sure what it has to do with the challenge except that I assume the vulture is caged...</td>', 'I like the textures and colors in this and the composition is nice...not sure what it has to do with the challenge except that I assume the vulture is caged...', '2003-08-11 10:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
