(384178, 32890, 6624, '<td valign="top">good title!  good challenge response inside the geodesic dome and I like the composition overall - it has motion in its stillness</td>', 'good title!  good challenge response inside the geodesic dome and I like the composition overall - it has motion in its stillness', '2003-08-11 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
