(384186, 32858, 6624, '<td valign="top">the kaleidoscope effect really works...and interesting response to the challenge<br/>the blur of the right, while it gives motion is a bit distracting to me</td>', 'the kaleidoscope effect really works...and interesting response to the challengethe blur of the right, while it gives motion is a bit distracting to me', '2003-08-11 11:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
