(384228, 32919, 6624, '<td valign="top">more light in the foreground or more detail would have helped this but the almost watercolor effect of the tree outside the window is wonderful<br/>title isn''t clear to me</td>', 'more light in the foreground or more detail would have helped this but the almost watercolor effect of the tree outside the window is wonderfultitle isn''t clear to me', '2003-08-11 11:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
