(384333, 32916, 10785, '<td valign="top">I gave this a high rating. Contrast is great, though it seems grainy. Maybe that''s just from resizing though. I gave it a nine!</td>', 'I gave this a high rating. Contrast is great, though it seems grainy. Maybe that''s just from resizing though. I gave it a nine!', '2003-08-11 12:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(384334, 32921, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - I like that "glow" that you''ve captured.</td>', 'Nice lighting - I like that "glow" that you''ve captured.', '2003-08-11 12:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(384338, 32591, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the framing concept here - the shape of the gate opening is appealing. However, IMHO, the view through is less appealing though and somewhat dark.</td>', 'I like the framing concept here - the shape of the gate opening is appealing. However, IMHO, the view through is less appealing though and somewhat dark.', '2003-08-11 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(384339, 32786, 10414, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  He looks like he''s frozen in the water!!!  :)</td>', 'Great picture!  He looks like he''s frozen in the water!!!  :)', '2003-08-11 12:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(384340, 32873, 10414, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!  I love views of big cities....especially ones I''ve been to before....thanks for taking me back!  :)  8</td>', 'Very nice picture!  I love views of big cities....especially ones I''ve been to before....thanks for taking me back!  :)  8', '2003-08-11 12:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(384343, 32847, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture....I want to be there!!!   :)</td>', 'Beautiful picture....I want to be there!!!   :)', '2003-08-11 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(384344, 32546, 10414, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty...beautiful eyes!!  Very nice picture overall!!  :)</td>', 'Cute kitty...beautiful eyes!!  Very nice picture overall!!  :)', '2003-08-11 12:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(384346, 32761, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot, though composition doesn''t quite grab me as strongly as it might. I wonder if the bars were either exactly horizontal/ vertical or much more on the diagonal whether it would improve impact for me? I do like the way you''ve chosen to crop tightly to include only one hand and part of the face.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot, though composition doesn''t quite grab me as strongly as it might. I wonder if the bars were either exactly horizontal/ vertical or much more on the diagonal whether it would improve impact for me? I do like the way you''ve chosen to crop tightly to include only one hand and part of the face.', '2003-08-11 12:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(384348, 32694, 10414, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I tried something like this for this challenge, but mine didn''t turn out like I wanted. You did what I couldn''t.....awesome job!!  :)</td>', 'Great picture! I tried something like this for this challenge, but mine didn''t turn out like I wanted. You did what I couldn''t.....awesome job!!  :)', '2003-08-11 12:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384351, 32619, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha - this one really made me think - first I was thinking "oh but that doesn''t look like eyelashes, it looks more like a zip" - then it was "OH a ZIP!" - and it clicked that the image was from the point of view of a one eyed snake looking out of the flies! Very witty, somewhat riske, and clever framing and composition. I think this is a strong entry!</td>', 'Ha ha ha - this one really made me think - first I was thinking "oh but that doesn''t look like eyelashes, it looks more like a zip" - then it was "OH a ZIP!" - and it clicked that the image was from the point of view of a one eyed snake looking out of the flies! Very witty, somewhat riske, and clever framing and composition. I think this is a strong entry!', '2003-08-11 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(384352, 32833, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful kitty......your picture is too dark to see much else though. :)</td>', 'Beautiful kitty......your picture is too dark to see much else though. :)', '2003-08-11 12:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(384354, 32871, 3087, '<td valign="top">A sweet picture and wonderful idea which would be immeasurably stronger, I think, if her eyes were visible. Instead I can see only black shadow and I really really want that eye contact - it seems to be the essence of the image!</td>', 'A sweet picture and wonderful idea which would be immeasurably stronger, I think, if her eyes were visible. Instead I can see only black shadow and I really really want that eye contact - it seems to be the essence of the image!', '2003-08-11 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(384356, 32893, 10414, '<td valign="top">Great, rich colors...kinda makes me want to kick my shoes off and run around in the grass! Thanks for taking me away from my computer...if only for a few minutes! :)</td>', 'Great, rich colors...kinda makes me want to kick my shoes off and run around in the grass! Thanks for taking me away from my computer...if only for a few minutes! :)', '2003-08-11 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(384357, 32600, 772, '<td valign="top">Cute dog... composition is fairly interesting here also... I''m confident that this photo is gonna be a bit of a ''stretch'' in this challenge because I don''t understand your interpretation very clearly here.  I think that that dog is ''inside'' the boat looking ''oustide'' the boat probably.... <br/> <br/>I think, based on that, you meet the challenge, but the THEME of the photo doesn''t seem to represent the challenge topic with much strength for me...</td>', 'Cute dog... composition is fairly interesting here also... I''m confident that this photo is gonna be a bit of a ''stretch'' in this challenge because I don''t understand your interpretation very clearly here.  I think that that dog is ''inside'' the boat looking ''oustide'' the boat probably....  I think, based on that, you meet the challenge, but the THEME of the photo doesn''t seem to represent the challenge topic with much strength for me...', '2003-08-11 13:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(384359, 32882, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken and good composition. Oddly enough, usually when I see an aquarium photo I feel it should be more like this (no sign of the aquarium surface itself, no reflections, no kids standing infront of the glass) but in this case, in this challenge I think it might be even better with a small child with their back to the camera to make it clearer the animal is looking out, or perhaps another visual clue that this is a confined space. That said, there are clues there, such as the clean curve of the tank surface so... it''s not like it''s not possible to figure out what one is looking at.<br/>Anyway, I think this is a really strong entry - best of luck!</td>', 'Nicely taken and good composition. Oddly enough, usually when I see an aquarium photo I feel it should be more like this (no sign of the aquarium surface itself, no reflections, no kids standing infront of the glass) but in this case, in this challenge I think it might be even better with a small child with their back to the camera to make it clearer the animal is looking out, or perhaps another visual clue that this is a confined space. That said, there are clues there, such as the clean curve of the tank surface so... it''s not like it''s not possible to figure out what one is looking at.Anyway, I think this is a really strong entry - best of luck!', '2003-08-11 13:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(384360, 32648, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhh......you get a 10 from me for the adorable little boy! He has beautiful, faraway eyes in this picture!!!! :)</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhh......you get a 10 from me for the adorable little boy! He has beautiful, faraway eyes in this picture!!!! :)', '2003-08-11 13:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(384362, 32828, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol That is too funny.  Very creative.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol That is too funny.  Very creative.  Jacko.  9', '2003-08-11 13:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(384363, 32867, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit... It is, however, a bit of a stretch on my interpretation of what this challenge should be...</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit... It is, however, a bit of a stretch on my interpretation of what this challenge should be...', '2003-08-11 13:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
