(384381, 32799, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely image with a lovely peaceful aspect. In terms of minor improvements (in my opinion only of course) I''d like to see the person move just a touch to their right so they don''t appear quite so squashed in to the side, though not too far, certainly not centred. I''d also prefer if their shoes weren''t so evident - black shoes would look best. That said, perhaps this is a candid rather than a posed shot, in which case, all I can say is, well spotted!!</td>', 'A lovely image with a lovely peaceful aspect. In terms of minor improvements (in my opinion only of course) I''d like to see the person move just a touch to their right so they don''t appear quite so squashed in to the side, though not too far, certainly not centred. I''d also prefer if their shoes weren''t so evident - black shoes would look best. That said, perhaps this is a candid rather than a posed shot, in which case, all I can say is, well spotted!!', '2003-08-11 13:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
