(384412, 32615, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites. The muted colors and theme make this feel like a screen capture from an old movie.  Her eyes are beautiful and haunting and I like how her hat and hair fade into the shadow of the trunk. If I could vote, I would definitely give this a 10.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites. The muted colors and theme make this feel like a screen capture from an old movie.  Her eyes are beautiful and haunting and I like how her hat and hair fade into the shadow of the trunk. If I could vote, I would definitely give this a 10.', '2003-08-11 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
