(384414, 32272, 3087, '<td valign="top">Another of my favourites in this challenge. <br/>Lighting is spot on - the way it paints the threads of that web is wonderful and the pools of light outside make that view, though undefined, seem appealing. <br/>Using the window frame as both border and framing for the view works very well and creates a very strong composition.<br/>Black and white is absolutely right for the image.<br/>I''m sure (and I hope) this will do well.</td>', 'Another of my favourites in this challenge. Lighting is spot on - the way it paints the threads of that web is wonderful and the pools of light outside make that view, though undefined, seem appealing. Using the window frame as both border and framing for the view works very well and creates a very strong composition.Black and white is absolutely right for the image.I''m sure (and I hope) this will do well.', '2003-08-11 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384415, 32912, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The choice to position the dog so that only part of his face is visible works well. I also like the chosen crop of how much window to include/ exclude. The one main pane is nicely balanced by the small included areas of the other 3 panes. I also like the contrast between the exterior white paint and the dark textured material inside the window - the same contrasts reflected in Fido himself. A strong image!</td>', 'Nice composition. The choice to position the dog so that only part of his face is visible works well. I also like the chosen crop of how much window to include/ exclude. The one main pane is nicely balanced by the small included areas of the other 3 panes. I also like the contrast between the exterior white paint and the dark textured material inside the window - the same contrasts reflected in Fido himself. A strong image!', '2003-08-11 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(384417, 32615, 3087, '<td valign="top">Other than the desaturated colour I think this image is lovely - reminds me of the books I''d read as a child.</td>', 'Other than the desaturated colour I think this image is lovely - reminds me of the books I''d read as a child.', '2003-08-11 13:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(384418, 32570, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is very cute.   Very original and funny theme.  Apparently she was moving her hands when you took the picture and the slight blur is a little distracting, but the colors are good.  I do wish she didn''t look quite so frightened. Doing the same thing but getting her to put a hand on her cheek and just look bored might be a little less disconcerting, considering you are using a child in the shot. You dont'' want to get the idea that the child is distraught in any way.</td>', 'This is very cute.   Very original and funny theme.  Apparently she was moving her hands when you took the picture and the slight blur is a little distracting, but the colors are good.  I do wish she didn''t look quite so frightened. Doing the same thing but getting her to put a hand on her cheek and just look bored might be a little less disconcerting, considering you are using a child in the shot. You dont'' want to get the idea that the child is distraught in any way.', '2003-08-11 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
