(384502, 32829, 3080, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been commenting a lot lately, but I just have to say that this shot is creepy as hell.  The thumbnail looks like a face!!  The eye being the area where the mother and child are, there is a nose shaped area where the grass meets the water, and the dark spot in the water resembles a mouth.  This is a really great photo.  I like how you have framed the mother and child, and your focus and clarity are really good as well.  Very dreamy.  And quite creepy in the thumbnail size. ~Heather~</td>', 'I haven''t been commenting a lot lately, but I just have to say that this shot is creepy as hell.  The thumbnail looks like a face!!  The eye being the area where the mother and child are, there is a nose shaped area where the grass meets the water, and the dark spot in the water resembles a mouth.  This is a really great photo.  I like how you have framed the mother and child, and your focus and clarity are really good as well.  Very dreamy.  And quite creepy in the thumbnail size. ~Heather~', '2003-08-11 14:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(384506, 32615, 715, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I especially like the old-fashioned look you achieved. Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I especially like the old-fashioned look you achieved. Great job!', '2003-08-11 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(384507, 32272, 9295, '<td valign="top">As this photo was loading and all I could see was the top two panels, I thought it was a broken window. But then, as the rest of the picture was revealed and I realized it was a spider web, your title really had meaning. I love everything about this picture, from the great lighting on the window panes and web to the blur of the background to the framing to the lack of color.  Extraordinary shot.  Good luck with the challenge. This looks like a ribbon-winner to me!</td>', 'As this photo was loading and all I could see was the top two panels, I thought it was a broken window. But then, as the rest of the picture was revealed and I realized it was a spider web, your title really had meaning. I love everything about this picture, from the great lighting on the window panes and web to the blur of the background to the framing to the lack of color.  Extraordinary shot.  Good luck with the challenge. This looks like a ribbon-winner to me!', '2003-08-11 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(384509, 32500, 10643, '<td valign="top">This is just stunning. Really nice work.</td>', 'This is just stunning. Really nice work.', '2003-08-11 14:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(384514, 32874, 715, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. Using the plant in the foreground to create depth in the photo is working very well.<br/>Personally I would have cropped off  the upper horizontal part of the window-frame. I think it will make the photo less crowded and  the remaining parts of the frame will act  more as visual guidelines towards the real points of interrest (the cat and the plant). Just my opinion though :)</td>', 'A very nice image. Using the plant in the foreground to create depth in the photo is working very well.Personally I would have cropped off  the upper horizontal part of the window-frame. I think it will make the photo less crowded and  the remaining parts of the frame will act  more as visual guidelines towards the real points of interrest (the cat and the plant). Just my opinion though :)', '2003-08-11 15:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
