(384845, 32500, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great concept, expertly executed... A lot of Wow to my eye. 10</td>', 'Great concept, expertly executed... A lot of Wow to my eye. 10', '2003-08-11 23:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(384848, 32391, 2567, '<td valign="top">This isn''t very appealing to me and I think that apeal is a large part of photography.  It is an interesting way of approaching the challenge though.  Good luck.</td>', 'This isn''t very appealing to me and I think that apeal is a large part of photography.  It is an interesting way of approaching the challenge though.  Good luck.', '2003-08-11 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(384849, 32546, 2337, '<td valign="top">While I''m no cat lover, this has a lot of merit.  The downside for me is the somewhat cluttered background.  Just a thought... Had you considered cropping the right side closer?  I looked at it cropped to the edge of the ''bed'' the cat is on and to my eye it improved the photo quite a bit... <br/> <br/>But that''s just me :)</td>', 'While I''m no cat lover, this has a lot of merit.  The downside for me is the somewhat cluttered background.  Just a thought... Had you considered cropping the right side closer?  I looked at it cropped to the edge of the ''bed'' the cat is on and to my eye it improved the photo quite a bit...  But that''s just me :)', '2003-08-11 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(384850, 32753, 2567, '<td valign="top">This isn\''t very appealing to me and I think that apeal is a large part of photography.  It is an interesting way of approaching the challenge though.  Good luck.</td>', 'This isn\''t very appealing to me and I think that apeal is a large part of photography.  It is an interesting way of approaching the challenge though.  Good luck.', '2003-08-11 23:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(384851, 32829, 2567, '<td valign="top">I think this as being more like outside looking in.  Great capture of the subjects though.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this as being more like outside looking in.  Great capture of the subjects though.  Good luck.', '2003-08-11 23:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(384852, 32858, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  I normally don''t care much for abstracts but this one is rather nice.  I like the off centered perspective.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  I normally don''t care much for abstracts but this one is rather nice.  I like the off centered perspective.', '2003-08-11 23:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(384853, 32775, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image that has considerable technical merit... My only problem is I''ve been having a hard time relating it to the challenge. Am I missing something obvious here?  Feel free to PM if you like.</td>', 'This is an interesting image that has considerable technical merit... My only problem is I''ve been having a hard time relating it to the challenge. Am I missing something obvious here?  Feel free to PM if you like.', '2003-08-11 23:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
