(384855, 32277, 2337, '<td valign="top">It''s a stretch for the challenge, but I tend to give the benefit of the doubt when possible.  The lighting seemed a little strong in spots and nonexistent elsewhere.  Composition is quite nice.</td>', 'It''s a stretch for the challenge, but I tend to give the benefit of the doubt when possible.  The lighting seemed a little strong in spots and nonexistent elsewhere.  Composition is quite nice.', '2003-08-11 23:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
