(384886, 32912, 9679, '<td valign="top">Lots for the eye to linger on here... the peeling paint, the textured curtain, and the dog''s expression is perfect. Nice work!</td>', 'Lots for the eye to linger on here... the peeling paint, the textured curtain, and the dog''s expression is perfect. Nice work!', '2003-08-12 00:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(384887, 32757, 9679, '<td valign="top">I like how the black and white of the puppy and container contrast with the grass.  Nice DOF. He looks like he''s hiding... very touching.</td>', 'I like how the black and white of the puppy and container contrast with the grass.  Nice DOF. He looks like he''s hiding... very touching.', '2003-08-12 00:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
