(385226, 32890, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  This makes mw want to take my three boys down to the playground right now and copy your creativity!!  Your composition is excellent.  I''m assuming this is pretty well backlit and you used flash for frontal details??  Is he holding his breath??  Thaks for the great idea and I hope I am able to get a shot as good as yours!  I give it a 10!  Good Luck!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'I love this shot!  This makes mw want to take my three boys down to the playground right now and copy your creativity!!  Your composition is excellent.  I''m assuming this is pretty well backlit and you used flash for frontal details??  Is he holding his breath??  Thaks for the great idea and I hope I am able to get a shot as good as yours!  I give it a 10!  Good Luck!JD Anderson', '2003-08-12 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
