(385338, 32345, 6597, '<td valign="top">creative</td>', 'creative', '2003-08-12 14:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(385349, 32829, 6999, '<td valign="top">Given the challenge, this ought actually to be a very creepy photograph: inside what? My presumption being that the photographer is hiding somehow, or concealed, and therefore elements of stalking, and kidnapping and murder are brought to the image. Especially creepy given the over-romantic treatment of the scene. However ...<br/> <br/>I think I''m bringing that to this shot, rather than being shown it: some suggestion of a window or of concealment would have helped, maybe. Otherwise it''s just a good portrait scene - no, a very very good one - that seems to have been shoehorned into this challenge. You''re still getting a seven though, as it''s a wonderful portrait - worthy of the Agfa competition I''d have thought - which is a mark I never give to non-challenge-meeting shots.</td>', 'Given the challenge, this ought actually to be a very creepy photograph: inside what? My presumption being that the photographer is hiding somehow, or concealed, and therefore elements of stalking, and kidnapping and murder are brought to the image. Especially creepy given the over-romantic treatment of the scene. However ... I think I''m bringing that to this shot, rather than being shown it: some suggestion of a window or of concealment would have helped, maybe. Otherwise it''s just a good portrait scene - no, a very very good one - that seems to have been shoehorned into this challenge. You''re still getting a seven though, as it''s a wonderful portrait - worthy of the Agfa competition I''d have thought - which is a mark I never give to non-challenge-meeting shots.', '2003-08-12 15:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(385351, 32918, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good stuff - especially like the fingers poking through there. Lighting makes it a little flat though, but that''s difficult in this situation.</td>', 'Good stuff - especially like the fingers poking through there. Lighting makes it a little flat though, but that''s difficult in this situation.', '2003-08-12 15:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(385356, 32500, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa - this is a most creepy photograph - I think it''s the hair, and the chipped paint on the face, but it gave me a shiver when i saw it.</td>', 'Whoa - this is a most creepy photograph - I think it''s the hair, and the chipped paint on the face, but it gave me a shiver when i saw it.', '2003-08-12 15:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
