(385445, 32311, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite perspective for this challenge, and you have done it very well.  8.</td>', 'This is my favorite perspective for this challenge, and you have done it very well.  8.', '2003-08-12 16:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(385480, 32864, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is a very fun image.  I have three little boys and I know how hard it is to get a great shot of them.  The focus seems a tiny bit soft on her face, but the concept, composition, lighting, etc are all wonderful!  I give it a 9 (10 with sharp focus).  Good job!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'This is a very fun image.  I have three little boys and I know how hard it is to get a great shot of them.  The focus seems a tiny bit soft on her face, but the concept, composition, lighting, etc are all wonderful!  I give it a 9 (10 with sharp focus).  Good job!JD Anderson', '2003-08-12 17:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(385483, 32912, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nothing but a 10 will work for this image.  Great technicals, great composition!  Perfect all the way around.  Great job!  JD Anderson</td>', 'Nothing but a 10 will work for this image.  Great technicals, great composition!  Perfect all the way around.  Great job!  JD Anderson', '2003-08-12 17:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(385484, 32872, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image, and well executed, but it gives me the creeps for some reason.  I hate the feel of panty hose...  that''s probably it!  Nicely done, though. 9<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'This is a fun image, and well executed, but it gives me the creeps for some reason.  I hate the feel of panty hose...  that''s probably it!  Nicely done, though. 9JD Anderson', '2003-08-12 17:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(385520, 32757, 3447, '<td valign="top">A very appealing photograph.  Certainly fits the challenge...good composition, focus and lighting.  This is a high number vote.</td>', 'A very appealing photograph.  Certainly fits the challenge...good composition, focus and lighting.  This is a high number vote.', '2003-08-12 18:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(385526, 32906, 3447, '<td valign="top">The technicians will give you a hard time. I like your photograph.</td>', 'The technicians will give you a hard time. I like your photograph.', '2003-08-12 19:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(385528, 32570, 3447, '<td valign="top">This will no doubt traumatize this cute child and lead her into a life of depravity and crime.   And it will be all your fault!   8</td>', 'This will no doubt traumatize this cute child and lead her into a life of depravity and crime.   And it will be all your fault!   8', '2003-08-12 19:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(385538, 32796, 3447, '<td valign="top">An \"A\" for clever...and meeting the challenge also.  Won\''t niggle about the blown out window light.</td>', 'An \"A\" for clever...and meeting the challenge also.  Won\''t niggle about the blown out window light.', '2003-08-12 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(385543, 32829, 2125, '<td valign="top">i like this one a lot...9</td>', 'i like this one a lot...9', '2003-08-12 19:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(385545, 32757, 2125, '<td valign="top">excellent shot color composition and focus...10</td>', 'excellent shot color composition and focus...10', '2003-08-12 19:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(385546, 32916, 3447, '<td valign="top">Awww - the other photographers are gonna hate you.  I like this photograph, and it nails the challenge.  Just ignore the complaints about focus and light.  8</td>', 'Awww - the other photographers are gonna hate you.  I like this photograph, and it nails the challenge.  Just ignore the complaints about focus and light.  8', '2003-08-12 19:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(385557, 32871, 3447, '<td valign="top">Terrific concept and execution.  8</td>', 'Terrific concept and execution.  8', '2003-08-12 19:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(385560, 32591, 3447, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colors and composition.  Yes, a fill flash would have been nice, and the light on the flowers is too much on top.  This photo gets a high mark from me.</td>', 'Pleasing colors and composition.  Yes, a fill flash would have been nice, and the light on the flowers is too much on top.  This photo gets a high mark from me.', '2003-08-12 19:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(385616, 32716, 10250, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The contrast is great, the depth of field is perfect, and the use of line and shadow really brings the image together. Well done. 10.</td>', 'I like this a lot. The contrast is great, the depth of field is perfect, and the use of line and shadow really brings the image together. Well done. 10.', '2003-08-12 21:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(385666, 32886, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the composition though the bright reflection on the water seems a bit too birght.</td>', 'I like the composition though the bright reflection on the water seems a bit too birght.', '2003-08-12 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(385667, 31934, 3554, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo for the challenge. I love the expression in the eyes. The gray background is a bit noisy/pixilated. 9</td>', 'Excellent photo for the challenge. I love the expression in the eyes. The gray background is a bit noisy/pixilated. 9', '2003-08-12 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(385669, 32615, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting of this shot and the coloring. It feels like something from the early days of color film.</td>', 'I really like the lighting of this shot and the coloring. It feels like something from the early days of color film.', '2003-08-12 23:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(385670, 32912, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping and contrast. Defiintely fulfills the challenge.</td>', 'Nice cropping and contrast. Defiintely fulfills the challenge.', '2003-08-12 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(385673, 32914, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and contrast. I like the DOF. The top left corner (I''m not sure what that is) is a little distracting.</td>', 'Great lighting and contrast. I like the DOF. The top left corner (I''m not sure what that is) is a little distracting.', '2003-08-12 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(385676, 32311, 3554, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, I like the idea. Overall the picture doesn''t evoke much emotion in me, but it certainly meets the challenge. A different color of paint (brighter) might have made this more visually appealing to simple folk like me who like a lot of color.  :)  The bright lighting on the handle of the paint brush helps me feel that the outside is out there and adds to the illusion that I''m in the paint can.The color of the sky/ceiling is a bit drab.</td>', 'Clever shot, I like the idea. Overall the picture doesn''t evoke much emotion in me, but it certainly meets the challenge. A different color of paint (brighter) might have made this more visually appealing to simple folk like me who like a lot of color.  :)  The bright lighting on the handle of the paint brush helps me feel that the outside is out there and adds to the illusion that I''m in the paint can.The color of the sky/ceiling is a bit drab.', '2003-08-12 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(385678, 32829, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It tells a story, its visually appealing, the way you look out at the mother and son through the window of leaves is creative. I like the soft light for this shot. The creek in the foreground seems like it could be a little more in focus but I''m not sure that would be better.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It tells a story, its visually appealing, the way you look out at the mother and son through the window of leaves is creative. I like the soft light for this shot. The creek in the foreground seems like it could be a little more in focus but I''m not sure that would be better.', '2003-08-12 23:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(385681, 32890, 3554, '<td valign="top">You captured a great expression on his face. The angles of his body and the angles of the contraption he''s climbing on complement each other.</td>', 'You captured a great expression on his face. The angles of his body and the angles of the contraption he''s climbing on complement each other.', '2003-08-12 23:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(385682, 32812, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of seeing what the mirror sees, that the mirror is looking out at me. The contrast of the mirrors contents and the gray background the mirror sits on is striking.</td>', 'I like the idea of seeing what the mirror sees, that the mirror is looking out at me. The contrast of the mirrors contents and the gray background the mirror sits on is striking.', '2003-08-12 23:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(385686, 32757, 6202, '<td valign="top">I simply adore this photo...very nicely done.  My fav for the week.</td>', 'I simply adore this photo...very nicely done.  My fav for the week.', '2003-08-12 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(385687, 32619, 3554, '<td valign="top">Creative though something about the intent of the photo and the beauty of the image (and its wonderful color) doesn''t quite work for me. I can''t decide whether to be amused or not and that makes it difficult to just enjoy the photo.</td>', 'Creative though something about the intent of the photo and the beauty of the image (and its wonderful color) doesn''t quite work for me. I can''t decide whether to be amused or not and that makes it difficult to just enjoy the photo.', '2003-08-12 23:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(385688, 32859, 3554, '<td valign="top">You captured a great expression. There''s a lot of stroy here. Nice work.</td>', 'You captured a great expression. There''s a lot of stroy here. Nice work.', '2003-08-12 23:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(385691, 32901, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, I like this better than the refrigerator shots. Not too crazy about the soft foreground or the mail in the picture though.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, I like this better than the refrigerator shots. Not too crazy about the soft foreground or the mail in the picture though.', '2003-08-12 23:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(385693, 32867, 3554, '<td valign="top">Seems like every challenge has a macro of a flower in it. This particular image doesn''t really convey the challenge to me in a meaningful way. I think you could have stretched your creative limits a bit more in this challenge.</td>', 'Seems like every challenge has a macro of a flower in it. This particular image doesn''t really convey the challenge to me in a meaningful way. I think you could have stretched your creative limits a bit more in this challenge.', '2003-08-12 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(385696, 32691, 3554, '<td valign="top">This could have been a good subject but I think your angle on it doesn''t really capture it. I think it would have worked a lot better if you''d taken it from the front, perhaps zooming in so all you saw were his hands framing his face. It''s a nice clear picture though.</td>', 'This could have been a good subject but I think your angle on it doesn''t really capture it. I think it would have worked a lot better if you''d taken it from the front, perhaps zooming in so all you saw were his hands framing his face. It''s a nice clear picture though.', '2003-08-12 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(385700, 31941, 3554, '<td valign="top">While this could have been taken from inside a window nothing about the composition of the shot conveys the challenge to me. It strikes me as just another bug macro. Try to stretch your creativity a bit more next time.</td>', 'While this could have been taken from inside a window nothing about the composition of the shot conveys the challenge to me. It strikes me as just another bug macro. Try to stretch your creativity a bit more next time.', '2003-08-12 23:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(385703, 32870, 3554, '<td valign="top">Titles can impact your audience''s appreciation of a photo. Your title seems a bit sentimental to me. It''s harder for someone who doesn''t know you to relate. Instead I might have titled it "Tommy''s eyes" Your audience can relate to "Tommy" because they can see him.  I hope that makes sense.</td>', 'Titles can impact your audience''s appreciation of a photo. Your title seems a bit sentimental to me. It''s harder for someone who doesn''t know you to relate. Instead I might have titled it "Tommy''s eyes" Your audience can relate to "Tommy" because they can see him.  I hope that makes sense.', '2003-08-12 23:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(385730, 32799, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think the way you cropped this works well. There''s nothing distracting in the picture.</td>', 'I think the way you cropped this works well. There''s nothing distracting in the picture.', '2003-08-12 23:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(385733, 32833, 3554, '<td valign="top">You can really feel the glass in this shot. The reflected image lets us see what the cat would see. All around good work. The top of the cats head seems to be very slightly overexposed and there are some streaks in the top right corner that I wish weren''t there.</td>', 'You can really feel the glass in this shot. The reflected image lets us see what the cat would see. All around good work. The top of the cats head seems to be very slightly overexposed and there are some streaks in the top right corner that I wish weren''t there.', '2003-08-13 00:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(385734, 32918, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like this. It reminds me of late 50''s B horror shows. If that was the intent you captured it pretty well.</td>', 'I like this. It reminds me of late 50''s B horror shows. If that was the intent you captured it pretty well.', '2003-08-13 00:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(385735, 32775, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot, but I''m not making the connection to the challenge very well.</td>', 'I like the photo a lot, but I''m not making the connection to the challenge very well.', '2003-08-13 00:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(385737, 32871, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and overall composition. Would be better if there wasn''t a flash or light reflection on her forehead.</td>', 'Good DOF and overall composition. Would be better if there wasn''t a flash or light reflection on her forehead.', '2003-08-13 00:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(385743, 32757, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and interesting subject. The top of the cup/pitcher is a bit too bright relative to the lighting on the inside and the dog.</td>', 'Good DOF and interesting subject. The top of the cup/pitcher is a bit too bright relative to the lighting on the inside and the dog.', '2003-08-13 00:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(385771, 32919, 3554, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of light and contrast. I can just imagine the musician practicing while looking out into a beautiful garden. I like the title too.</td>', 'Really nice use of light and contrast. I can just imagine the musician practicing while looking out into a beautiful garden. I like the title too.', '2003-08-13 00:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(385782, 32908, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but the light is harsh and frankly the inside of your refrigerator isn''t all that interesting of a subject. Also I''d get rid of the trash can in the background. The title''s fun though you might have had the person in the shot look really surprised as though they''d been caught by the fridge police. A red white and blue strobe light might have made a huge difference if you really wanted to play up that angle.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but the light is harsh and frankly the inside of your refrigerator isn''t all that interesting of a subject. Also I''d get rid of the trash can in the background. The title''s fun though you might have had the person in the shot look really surprised as though they''d been caught by the fridge police. A red white and blue strobe light might have made a huge difference if you really wanted to play up that angle.', '2003-08-13 00:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(385787, 32810, 3554, '<td valign="top">While this meets the challenge the photo feels flat and uninteresting. If you wanted the flag to be central you might have focused on it and blurred the background.</td>', 'While this meets the challenge the photo feels flat and uninteresting. If you wanted the flag to be central you might have focused on it and blurred the background.', '2003-08-13 00:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(385790, 32826, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love how black the negative space is. Good lighting and contrast. The window reminds me of a puzzle piece.</td>', 'I love how black the negative space is. Good lighting and contrast. The window reminds me of a puzzle piece.', '2003-08-13 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(385791, 32873, 3554, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for your title I wouldn''t connect with the challenge from this shot. It would have helped if there were some perspective of being inside and looking out.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for your title I wouldn''t connect with the challenge from this shot. It would have helped if there were some perspective of being inside and looking out.', '2003-08-13 00:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(385968, 32757, 10777, '<td valign="top">and the winner is.....</td>', 'and the winner is.....', '2003-08-13 02:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(386045, 32757, 4090, '<td valign="top">so so cute 10/10</td>', 'so so cute 10/10', '2003-08-13 03:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(386376, 32919, 5728, '<td valign="top">I just love the way you can still see everything outside the window in detail as well as everything in the room. Not easy to do!</td>', 'I just love the way you can still see everything outside the window in detail as well as everything in the room. Not easy to do!', '2003-08-13 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386482, 32859, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... i love the old school photography feel of this one.  This sorta reminds me of a ''grapes of wrath'' type scene... a bit of despair maybe... tired eyes... long day of hard work... great shot :) = 10</td>', 'beautiful shot... i love the old school photography feel of this one.  This sorta reminds me of a ''grapes of wrath'' type scene... a bit of despair maybe... tired eyes... long day of hard work... great shot :) = 10', '2003-08-13 11:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(386649, 32600, 10643, '<td valign="top">It''s sort of alarming that the dog is so interested in what he sees but the man driving the boat is looking in a whole different direction!</td>', 'It''s sort of alarming that the dog is so interested in what he sees but the man driving the boat is looking in a whole different direction!', '2003-08-13 13:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(386650, 32487, 7190, '<td valign="top">this has some nice elements wished the outside light weren''t as bright. wondering did you bracketed  your shot . it would been nice to pick up more outside detail</td>', 'this has some nice elements wished the outside light weren''t as bright. wondering did you bracketed  your shot . it would been nice to pick up more outside detail', '2003-08-13 13:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(386762, 32872, 9232, '<td valign="top">Intriguiging.  I see not only the actual fingers through the nylon (my assumption) but also a pair of lips.  I think this photo should be put out to more communities than this one to get feedback as it is interesting on several levels.</td>', 'Intriguiging.  I see not only the actual fingers through the nylon (my assumption) but also a pair of lips.  I think this photo should be put out to more communities than this one to get feedback as it is interesting on several levels.', '2003-08-13 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(386767, 32906, 9232, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  It has an atmosphere of surrealism.  My first thought was of a ghost or spirit watching, trying to understand or communicate.</td>', 'I like this photo.  It has an atmosphere of surrealism.  My first thought was of a ghost or spirit watching, trying to understand or communicate.', '2003-08-13 14:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386778, 32859, 9232, '<td valign="top">The look on the model''s face is good with most of the tones but the darker tones behind the model and the hot light around the bottom of the photo don''t seem to compliment the central subject.  The use of the window frame is good.  I would have liked it better if you could have diffused some of the light that hits the bottom of the image.</td>', 'The look on the model''s face is good with most of the tones but the darker tones behind the model and the hot light around the bottom of the photo don''t seem to compliment the central subject.  The use of the window frame is good.  I would have liked it better if you could have diffused some of the light that hits the bottom of the image.', '2003-08-13 14:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(386789, 32591, 9232, '<td valign="top">The metering in this photo was challenging I''m sure.  The dark bricks on the right with the sunlit bush on the left probably overwhelmed the camera.  I wonder how this shot would have come out if somoene were standing out of view to the left with a large piece of white posterboard or something to reflect some light back into the bricks.  The bars in the FG are already black but I''m thinking that will a little side light flowing into the bricks you could have stepped the lens down a little and gotten more definition on the bush and blossoms without losing any of the brickwork.  7</td>', 'The metering in this photo was challenging I''m sure.  The dark bricks on the right with the sunlit bush on the left probably overwhelmed the camera.  I wonder how this shot would have come out if somoene were standing out of view to the left with a large piece of white posterboard or something to reflect some light back into the bricks.  The bars in the FG are already black but I''m thinking that will a little side light flowing into the bricks you could have stepped the lens down a little and gotten more definition on the bush and blossoms without losing any of the brickwork.  7', '2003-08-13 14:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(386796, 32886, 9232, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the color choices.  What method did you use to get these tones?  Good use of textures between the soft clouds, the active ocean and the dead/inert limb and cave.<br/>With this being grayscale or duotone I would like to see this a little less silver.  - 7</td>', 'Like the composition and the color choices.  What method did you use to get these tones?  Good use of textures between the soft clouds, the active ocean and the dead/inert limb and cave.With this being grayscale or duotone I would like to see this a little less silver.  - 7', '2003-08-13 14:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(386900, 32765, 11167, '<td valign="top">thanks for using the picture of me aunt marianne!!!<br/>i love it</td>', 'thanks for using the picture of me aunt marianne!!!i love it', '2003-08-13 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(386961, 32757, 7711, '<td valign="top">awwww...you cot me. that''s way too cute. And I like the out of focus foreground. the framing of the shot is nice too, the green grass contrasts well.</td>', 'awwww...you cot me. that''s way too cute. And I like the out of focus foreground. the framing of the shot is nice too, the green grass contrasts well.', '2003-08-13 16:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(386977, 32716, 10611, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and shadow in this. I wish the net like shadows can be sharper. regardless, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I really like the light and shadow in this. I wish the net like shadows can be sharper. regardless, it''s a good shot.', '2003-08-13 16:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386985, 32277, 10611, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. I wonder is some details were lost when you resized. if we can see the bumps on the head much clearer this wouls be a better photo.</td>', 'Nice close up. I wonder is some details were lost when you resized. if we can see the bumps on the head much clearer this wouls be a better photo.', '2003-08-13 16:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(386987, 32916, 10611, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this image sharper and crop closer to the kid.</td>', 'I would like to see this image sharper and crop closer to the kid.', '2003-08-13 16:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(386989, 31934, 10611, '<td valign="top">to me this seem more like me looking at this person coming out of the box. but that''s just my interpretation</td>', 'to me this seem more like me looking at this person coming out of the box. but that''s just my interpretation', '2003-08-13 16:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(386993, 32916, 6597, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea and a good picture besides most Mothers have seen this many times</td>', 'This is an excellent idea and a good picture besides most Mothers have seen this many times', '2003-08-13 16:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(386996, 32324, 10611, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. I was hoping to see water and maybe a smasll animal out there. I think this idea is better than my shot.</td>', 'Nice perspective. I was hoping to see water and maybe a smasll animal out there. I think this idea is better than my shot.', '2003-08-13 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(386997, 32826, 10611, '<td valign="top">it''s a nice shot. but I feel like I''m looking @ a window. not looking out.</td>', 'it''s a nice shot. but I feel like I''m looking @ a window. not looking out.', '2003-08-13 16:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(386999, 32901, 10611, '<td valign="top">like most people commented on my shot. something on the other end might make this work better. like a hand reaching in.</td>', 'like most people commented on my shot. something on the other end might make this work better. like a hand reaching in.', '2003-08-13 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 1);
