(389761, 32781, 8779, '<td valign="top">Perhaps make the window more of the subject as the topic is "Inside looking out"... But I like the shadows and light. Maybe less wall more table and window. Good try =)</td>', 'Perhaps make the window more of the subject as the topic is "Inside looking out"... But I like the shadows and light. Maybe less wall more table and window. Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
