(389763, 32753, 8779, '<td valign="top">Too much noise personally. I cannot even make out what is being held in front of the face. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Too much noise personally. I cannot even make out what is being held in front of the face. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(389764, 32763, 8779, '<td valign="top">It doesnt work for me persoanlly. I do not find the subject interesting. There is a dark line on the left which stands out and throws off the composition, making it look uneven on both sides. However, I like the idea of within a camera. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'It doesnt work for me persoanlly. I do not find the subject interesting. There is a dark line on the left which stands out and throws off the composition, making it look uneven on both sides. However, I like the idea of within a camera. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(389765, 32871, 8779, '<td valign="top">Cute. I know it''s around the time when new teeth are coming and going faster than the 3:15 express, but perhaps the photo would have been more attrative with a closed lip smile? Also, the dpeth-of-field was too wide rendering the child''s hair to be slightly blury. However, nice idea. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Cute. I know it''s around the time when new teeth are coming and going faster than the 3:15 express, but perhaps the photo would have been more attrative with a closed lip smile? Also, the dpeth-of-field was too wide rendering the child''s hair to be slightly blury. However, nice idea. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(389766, 32905, 8779, '<td valign="top">Cute. Perhaps a tighter crop on subjects. There is, at the mo, a large space at the top of the image which is quite off-putting. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Cute. Perhaps a tighter crop on subjects. There is, at the mo, a large space at the top of the image which is quite off-putting. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(389767, 32873, 8779, '<td valign="top">Personally, the sea with the red cranes ruins this picture. Perhaps a tighter crop on the buildings with the nice colours? And the sky could have done with more color. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Personally, the sea with the red cranes ruins this picture. Perhaps a tighter crop on the buildings with the nice colours? And the sky could have done with more color. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(389770, 32915, 8779, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. however, I would have prefered a larger version of the Peeping Tom and for the closer objects to be sharp and not blurred. From a lower angle, perhaps you could have also minimised the gap between wheel and the peeper.</td>', 'Nice idea. however, I would have prefered a larger version of the Peeping Tom and for the closer objects to be sharp and not blurred. From a lower angle, perhaps you could have also minimised the gap between wheel and the peeper.', '2003-08-16 14:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(389771, 32648, 8779, '<td valign="top">Cute. Perhaps a little sharper on the face. Reflection of clock good idea, however not above the child''s head. Well done, Good try =) Perhaps a tighter crop on child''s head too</td>', 'Cute. Perhaps a little sharper on the face. Reflection of clock good idea, however not above the child''s head. Well done, Good try =) Perhaps a tighter crop on child''s head too', '2003-08-16 14:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(389773, 31941, 8779, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the dragon fly, but inside looking out of what? And also, it would have been nice to have the tips of the wings? Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Nice picture of the dragon fly, but inside looking out of what? And also, it would have been nice to have the tips of the wings? Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(389775, 32311, 8779, '<td valign="top">Nice one, but perhaps a brighter more contrasting back ground color? Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Nice one, but perhaps a brighter more contrasting back ground color? Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(389778, 32318, 8779, '<td valign="top">The greens and metal are a little distracting. and as they said, if you think you are too close, get closer =) Also, perhaps from a lower angle, you would not have had the lightness on the upper half of the picture from reflections. If you are to play with reflections, nice strong ones would be good. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'The greens and metal are a little distracting. and as they said, if you think you are too close, get closer =) Also, perhaps from a lower angle, you would not have had the lightness on the upper half of the picture from reflections. If you are to play with reflections, nice strong ones would be good. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 14:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(389780, 32489, 8779, '<td valign="top">lol. Nice try. But a nice burglar in red? Perhaps a black metalic torch with a nice black hat? The overall pic has a slight blue tinge that you could perhaps fix with software. Well done, Good try =) Oh adn also, perhaps more face, less plant with a nice close crop as at the mo, the plant is the main subject.</td>', 'lol. Nice try. But a nice burglar in red? Perhaps a black metalic torch with a nice black hat? The overall pic has a slight blue tinge that you could perhaps fix with software. Well done, Good try =) Oh adn also, perhaps more face, less plant with a nice close crop as at the mo, the plant is the main subject.', '2003-08-16 14:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(389783, 32487, 8779, '<td valign="top">Hmm, interesting contraption. However, the title of the topic is Inside looking out. Perhaps making the door more of the subject by standing back a little and taking a nice landscape pic of most of the door and some inside surroundings would have been effective as I really like the wood. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Hmm, interesting contraption. However, the title of the topic is Inside looking out. Perhaps making the door more of the subject by standing back a little and taking a nice landscape pic of most of the door and some inside surroundings would have been effective as I really like the wood. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(389784, 32498, 8779, '<td valign="top">Aww, poor little beasty. Interesting snap. However, the thick glass has prevented some light from getting into the glass and onto the main subject. The insect is beautiful with it''s vibrant colors. Perhaps a closer shot of the insect w/o chopping off its legs with the lip of the far and more light on the chutney? Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Aww, poor little beasty. Interesting snap. However, the thick glass has prevented some light from getting into the glass and onto the main subject. The insect is beautiful with it''s vibrant colors. Perhaps a closer shot of the insect w/o chopping off its legs with the lip of the far and more light on the chutney? Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(389785, 32891, 8779, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, however, I find the needles too bright rendering the rest of the interior a little too bland. Also, perhaps the image could be a little sharper?<br/> <br/>And the background of the other car''s wheel is a little distracting.<br/> <br/>Maybe a head on shot including lots of bonnet with the nice blues?</td>', 'I like the idea, however, I find the needles too bright rendering the rest of the interior a little too bland. Also, perhaps the image could be a little sharper? And the background of the other car''s wheel is a little distracting. Maybe a head on shot including lots of bonnet with the nice blues?', '2003-08-16 15:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(389786, 32173, 8779, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. However, cropping out the ugly grill may give the whole picture a whole new feel. And it would have been nice to have the light on the arc to have fallen a little further, but who can control the sun?</td>', 'Nice shot. However, cropping out the ugly grill may give the whole picture a whole new feel. And it would have been nice to have the light on the arc to have fallen a little further, but who can control the sun?', '2003-08-16 15:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(389787, 32864, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. A little more vibrant colors on the face would have made a good contrast with the nasty pipe. Also, with a shallower aperture, the girl''s face could be sharper as I personally feel that should be the main subject of this picture. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Interesting idea. A little more vibrant colors on the face would have made a good contrast with the nasty pipe. Also, with a shallower aperture, the girl''s face could be sharper as I personally feel that should be the main subject of this picture. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(389788, 32478, 8779, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I understand the blurred leaf was meant to prevent it from distracting the flower, but I personally feel that it would not due to the brilliant whiteness. To see the veins of the leaf in detail would be great! Also, try to include the whote flower as at the moment, it feels incomplete and I''m forever looking for the ends of those petals. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Nice idea. I understand the blurred leaf was meant to prevent it from distracting the flower, but I personally feel that it would not due to the brilliant whiteness. To see the veins of the leaf in detail would be great! Also, try to include the whote flower as at the moment, it feels incomplete and I''m forever looking for the ends of those petals. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(389789, 32694, 8779, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a nice close crop on the mirror as it is obvious from title and shape of the unique mirror what it is. I feel the background is distracting and with a a wider aperture, the background could have been thrown out of focus, but this would result in futher blurring on the black areas of the mirror. So, perhaps a nice shallow aperture but a nice close crop on the brilliant reflection of the mirror. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'I would have liked to see a nice close crop on the mirror as it is obvious from title and shape of the unique mirror what it is. I feel the background is distracting and with a a wider aperture, the background could have been thrown out of focus, but this would result in futher blurring on the black areas of the mirror. So, perhaps a nice shallow aperture but a nice close crop on the brilliant reflection of the mirror. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(389791, 32665, 8779, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! The only nag is the concrete at the bottom of the image. Before the image finished loading, I could at once recognise the blue and white cover above to know you are looking out without the need of the concrete renforcement. Therefore, you could have zoomed in a little more on the foutain and it''s brilliant blues and less shadowed area. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'I love this picture! The only nag is the concrete at the bottom of the image. Before the image finished loading, I could at once recognise the blue and white cover above to know you are looking out without the need of the concrete renforcement. Therefore, you could have zoomed in a little more on the foutain and it''s brilliant blues and less shadowed area. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(389792, 32546, 8779, '<td valign="top">The brighter shades on the pillow and the edge of the cage is distracting. So perhaps a tighter crop into the cat''s face with it''s briliant eyes may improve this image. Do not feel you need to show it is inside the cage w/ the white bar on the right. The squares of the window displays it brilliantly!</td>', 'The brighter shades on the pillow and the edge of the cage is distracting. So perhaps a tighter crop into the cat''s face with it''s briliant eyes may improve this image. Do not feel you need to show it is inside the cage w/ the white bar on the right. The squares of the window displays it brilliantly!', '2003-08-16 15:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(389793, 32892, 8779, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Just one nag, what is that dot?! It kills the uniformity of the background. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Brilliant. Just one nag, what is that dot?! It kills the uniformity of the background. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(389795, 32812, 8779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mirror. But perhaps a more interesting reflection? Roof, roots of ceiling lights and hidden stage lights are not much of an interest. ;) Stand on a chair if you have to!</td>', 'Beautiful mirror. But perhaps a more interesting reflection? Roof, roots of ceiling lights and hidden stage lights are not much of an interest. ;) Stand on a chair if you have to!', '2003-08-16 15:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(389798, 32757, 8779, '<td valign="top">Oh I want!!! So cute!! Once again, a nice tight crop cutting out the grass and more puppy would have been nice. Or maybe a crop of just its face and a little handle, to show what it''s in...</td>', 'Oh I want!!! So cute!! Once again, a nice tight crop cutting out the grass and more puppy would have been nice. Or maybe a crop of just its face and a little handle, to show what it''s in...', '2003-08-16 15:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(389800, 32391, 8779, '<td valign="top">To be honest, first thing I thought was: Ew. Then looking at it again I pondered what it has to do with inside looking out. One tip is to never go over the top in editing software with filters and such as they often become tacky. The eye at the bottom right of the image looked like it was squished in just so it would fit into the frame whereas the rest of the eyes were quite evenly spaced. I''m sorry, but this is a 1.</td>', 'To be honest, first thing I thought was: Ew. Then looking at it again I pondered what it has to do with inside looking out. One tip is to never go over the top in editing software with filters and such as they often become tacky. The eye at the bottom right of the image looked like it was squished in just so it would fit into the frame whereas the rest of the eyes were quite evenly spaced. I''m sorry, but this is a 1.', '2003-08-16 15:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(389801, 32882, 8779, '<td valign="top">Aww! You were right to keep in all that brilliant blueness! Good job.</td>', 'Aww! You were right to keep in all that brilliant blueness! Good job.', '2003-08-16 15:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(389803, 32497, 8779, '<td valign="top">AHh!! Dont attack me!! Unfortunately, this hand makes the onlookers feel like they are about to be throttled. Perhaps the man could have kneeled down and given us a nice large shot of his face with a thoughtful look. Also, a shallower aperture would have kept the fridge items sharp, which I think would improve the image. =)</td>', 'AHh!! Dont attack me!! Unfortunately, this hand makes the onlookers feel like they are about to be throttled. Perhaps the man could have kneeled down and given us a nice large shot of his face with a thoughtful look. Also, a shallower aperture would have kept the fridge items sharp, which I think would improve the image. =)', '2003-08-16 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(389808, 32898, 8779, '<td valign="top">Oh my! I just looked at a photo with the same idea! And I did suggest a face with an expression of thoughtfulness. However,the face is not as sharp as can be and a nice colour version would have shown the brilliant range of colors offered in a fridge. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Oh my! I just looked at a photo with the same idea! And I did suggest a face with an expression of thoughtfulness. However,the face is not as sharp as can be and a nice colour version would have shown the brilliant range of colors offered in a fridge. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(389812, 32799, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Perhaps crop off the bottom half of the person and the hidious white shoes. At the top it appreared to be such a traditional picture until the trainers came into view! Nice one though.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Perhaps crop off the bottom half of the person and the hidious white shoes. At the top it appreared to be such a traditional picture until the trainers came into view! Nice one though.', '2003-08-16 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(389814, 32223, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. However, I would have liked to see more of the drain pipe [being one of the most interesting subjects] and less of the wall on the bottom and right. I would persoanlly just chopped off all the bottom and right so the painting would be in the corner and see the full drainpipe. Half a drain pipe feels incomplete, I keep searching for the other half. Well done, Good try =)</td>', 'Interesting image. However, I would have liked to see more of the drain pipe [being one of the most interesting subjects] and less of the wall on the bottom and right. I would persoanlly just chopped off all the bottom and right so the painting would be in the corner and see the full drainpipe. Half a drain pipe feels incomplete, I keep searching for the other half. Well done, Good try =)', '2003-08-16 15:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(389848, 32909, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely pic, very contrasty and gives me a serene kind of mood. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Lovely pic, very contrasty and gives me a serene kind of mood. Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-08-16 17:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
