(390824, 32324, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative idea but IMO the lighting is too weak on the bird and the focus is on the teeth rather than on the bird outside the mouth.  I think you''d get more impact if the teeth were out of the depth of field.</td>', 'Creative idea but IMO the lighting is too weak on the bird and the focus is on the teeth rather than on the bird outside the mouth.  I think you''d get more impact if the teeth were out of the depth of field.', '2003-08-17 22:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(390825, 32765, 9232, '<td valign="top">Downcast eyes or at least no eye contact would have reinforced the concept of this image.</td>', 'Downcast eyes or at least no eye contact would have reinforced the concept of this image.', '2003-08-17 22:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(390828, 31941, 9241, '<td valign="top">nice capture but I dont feel it meets the challenge</td>', 'nice capture but I dont feel it meets the challenge', '2003-08-17 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(390829, 32615, 9241, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the muted colors, the textures and the perfect focus 10</td>', 'Great shot, I love the muted colors, the textures and the perfect focus 10', '2003-08-17 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(390835, 32272, 8377, '<td valign="top">LOVE this one.  I love the framing and the spiderweb.  Good dof.</td>', 'LOVE this one.  I love the framing and the spiderweb.  Good dof.', '2003-08-17 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(390838, 32912, 11034, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shoot. Congrat.</td>', 'This is my favorite shoot. Congrat.', '2003-08-17 23:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(390839, 32757, 5391, '<td valign="top">Adorable and heartwarming.  Nice composition, good exposure and color saturation.  9</td>', 'Adorable and heartwarming.  Nice composition, good exposure and color saturation.  9', '2003-08-17 23:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(390842, 32906, 7778, '<td valign="top">A dead-on, centred perspective, unusual considering the soft, ethereal image of the girl at the centre of this shot. What is striking here, IMO, is a balance that has been achieved between the soiled primary plane and the tender, almost fragile expression of her face. The warm range of tones here seem to be combatted by an array of errand light throught the space confining the subject. Again, the sum of the spatial effects of the light, although diffuse are sufficient to offset, even balance the \''grunge\'' primary plane.<br/> <br/>What I like about this shot is its absolutely \''unpretentious\'' capture of a moment. Emotive, magical, wonderful!</td>', 'A dead-on, centred perspective, unusual considering the soft, ethereal image of the girl at the centre of this shot. What is striking here, IMO, is a balance that has been achieved between the soiled primary plane and the tender, almost fragile expression of her face. The warm range of tones here seem to be combatted by an array of errand light throught the space confining the subject. Again, the sum of the spatial effects of the light, although diffuse are sufficient to offset, even balance the \''grunge\'' primary plane. What I like about this shot is its absolutely \''unpretentious\'' capture of a moment. Emotive, magical, wonderful!', '2003-08-17 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(390845, 32912, 7969, '<td valign="top">The compostion and textures of this shot really work for me.  Only downfall is the one pane of glass is a bit overexposed.  Great shot.</td>', 'The compostion and textures of this shot really work for me.  Only downfall is the one pane of glass is a bit overexposed.  Great shot.', '2003-08-17 23:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(390847, 32829, 7969, '<td valign="top">A shot where, IMO, softer focus works quite well.</td>', 'A shot where, IMO, softer focus works quite well.', '2003-08-17 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(390848, 32757, 2000, '<td valign="top">This is one of the cutest photographs I have seen in a long time.  I like the depth of field, but the cuteness is what really strikes me.  Comment only - no vote.</td>', 'This is one of the cutest photographs I have seen in a long time.  I like the depth of field, but the cuteness is what really strikes me.  Comment only - no vote.', '2003-08-17 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(390850, 32648, 7935, '<td valign="top">polarizer! polarizer!   the thermometer growing out his head is a big distraction    though this looks like it ''might'' be a candid    a 5   mainly because of the framing that the window provides</td>', 'polarizer! polarizer!   the thermometer growing out his head is a big distraction    though this looks like it ''might'' be a candid    a 5   mainly because of the framing that the window provides', '2003-08-18 00:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(390851, 32478, 7935, '<td valign="top">different    but  who can fit inside a leaf?   a 6</td>', 'different    but  who can fit inside a leaf?   a 6', '2003-08-18 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(390852, 32912, 7935, '<td valign="top">excellent use of rule of thirds  and the textures are interesting    a 7</td>', 'excellent use of rule of thirds  and the textures are interesting    a 7', '2003-08-18 00:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(390861, 32757, 6900, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Perfecto.  10</td>', 'Perfect.  Perfecto.  10', '2003-08-18 00:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
