(390863, 31941, 6900, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it''s inside of.  Good pic but don''t see it meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure what it''s inside of.  Good pic but don''t see it meeting the challenge.', '2003-08-18 00:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(390864, 32619, 6900, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHA<br/>Excellent work.  The implied idea is superb, wonderful, perfect.  Sexellent!  10</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHAExcellent work.  The implied idea is superb, wonderful, perfect.  Sexellent!  10', '2003-08-18 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(390866, 32694, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice!  When I thought about this challenge, I said "either we have to be inside looking out at something pretty or we have to be outside looking at something that is looking out and that something must be pretty.  In this case, you chose to be inside looking out at something pretty.  I like the way it repeats itself in the bg.  9</td>', 'Nice!  When I thought about this challenge, I said "either we have to be inside looking out at something pretty or we have to be outside looking at something that is looking out and that something must be pretty.  In this case, you chose to be inside looking out at something pretty.  I like the way it repeats itself in the bg.  9', '2003-08-18 00:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(390868, 32753, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the grain ruins it for me.  Looks like it was too dark and you over-curved it or something.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the grain ruins it for me.  Looks like it was too dark and you over-curved it or something.', '2003-08-18 00:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(390869, 32871, 6900, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Don''t cut her elbows off though!  The angles are crucial to the composition.  Wish I could see her eyes better.</td>', 'Cute!  Don''t cut her elbows off though!  The angles are crucial to the composition.  Wish I could see her eyes better.', '2003-08-18 00:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(390873, 32757, 7935, '<td valign="top">awwwwwwwww  this is wayyy  too cute  a 10</td>', 'awwwwwwwww  this is wayyy  too cute  a 10', '2003-08-18 00:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(390876, 32893, 6900, '<td valign="top">I find the image completely unappealing.  I\''d rather the entire subject wasn\''t there and it was just the field and mountains, though with bluer sky.  The subject doesn\''t hold any interest or value.  I dont even know really what those two things are.  Hope it helps.</td>', 'I find the image completely unappealing.  I\''d rather the entire subject wasn\''t there and it was just the field and mountains, though with bluer sky.  The subject doesn\''t hold any interest or value.  I dont even know really what those two things are.  Hope it helps.', '2003-08-18 00:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(390878, 32869, 6900, '<td valign="top">The door is way over exposed and the flag is out of place.  I don''t really like the bg much at all and it''s hard to see his face.</td>', 'The door is way over exposed and the flag is out of place.  I don''t really like the bg much at all and it''s hard to see his face.', '2003-08-18 00:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
