(390992, 32892, 10611, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments. <br/>Yes, I think if there''s something out there this might work better but my face seem to block out the light. and i dunno what that spot was. I check my kitchen ceiling and didn''t see anything.<br/>Anyway, this being my second submission(desolation was the first attempt) I am pretty proud of the results. Thank you all. and keep the comments coming so I can improve.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments. Yes, I think if there''s something out there this might work better but my face seem to block out the light. and i dunno what that spot was. I check my kitchen ceiling and didn''t see anything.Anyway, this being my second submission(desolation was the first attempt) I am pretty proud of the results. Thank you all. and keep the comments coming so I can improve.', '2003-08-18 01:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(391028, 32890, 5475, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Sonja, on a top ten finish!  I took my three boys to the park yesterday to do a similar shot, only to find out they have removed this piece of equipment!  Now I have to drive around town and find one of these!  I love your shot and I hope you don''t mind my copying it with my kids!  I''ll show you what I come up with!  take care,<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Congrats, Sonja, on a top ten finish!  I took my three boys to the park yesterday to do a similar shot, only to find out they have removed this piece of equipment!  Now I have to drive around town and find one of these!  I love your shot and I hope you don''t mind my copying it with my kids!  I''ll show you what I come up with!  take care,JD Anderson', '2003-08-18 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 0),
