(391527, 32912, 255, '<td valign="top">thanks so much for the wonderful comments, everyone! :) <br/>this shot was just lucky all the way around. it was taken the last day we were in atlanta--dropping a friend off at her brother''s house, i saw lazlo peeking at us thru the door and thought it was too cute. grabbed my camera and took 4 shots with different compositions (my favorite version of this shot actually is only one pane, but i didnt think it showed enough window to meet the challenge). when i got home and saw that the new challenge was inside looking out, i was like, you''ve got to be kidding me!! lucky luck! ;)<br/> <br/>jacko, i just couldnt bring myself to take the <i>hoss</i> to atlanta! <br/> <br/>thanks again! :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'thanks so much for the wonderful comments, everyone! :) this shot was just lucky all the way around. it was taken the last day we were in atlanta--dropping a friend off at her brother''s house, i saw lazlo peeking at us thru the door and thought it was too cute. grabbed my camera and took 4 shots with different compositions (my favorite version of this shot actually is only one pane, but i didnt think it showed enough window to meet the challenge). when i got home and saw that the new challenge was inside looking out, i was like, you''ve got to be kidding me!! lucky luck! ;) jacko, i just couldnt bring myself to take the hoss to atlanta!  thanks again! :) ', '2003-08-18 12:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
