(392583, 32757, 6679, '<td valign="top">You should print an 8x10 and frame it in some room of your house with a nice matte and frame.  As this puppy grows older you''ll always get a smile and feel good remembering those puppy months.  I have puppy picks in my house and although I see them everyday; some days I really feel great seeing my ''babies'' as pups.<br/> <br/>This photo is a treasure.  Your others are as well.<br/> <br/>Please check out my latest related project: www.danterpstra.com/puppies<br/> <br/>DanTerpstra.com<br/> <br/><b>text</b><b>text</b><b>text</b></td>', 'You should print an 8x10 and frame it in some room of your house with a nice matte and frame.  As this puppy grows older you''ll always get a smile and feel good remembering those puppy months.  I have puppy picks in my house and although I see them everyday; some days I really feel great seeing my ''babies'' as pups. This photo is a treasure.  Your others are as well. Please check out my latest related project: www.danterpstra.com/puppies DanTerpstra.com texttexttext', '2003-08-19 08:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
