(563466, 32615, 806, '<td valign="top">I guess I wasn''t around during this challenge.. and unfortunately missed this shot. Very well done, love the look on the child''s face and especially in her eyes. the tight crop gives the impression of very little space inside the trunk, and makes the viewer wonder what is beyond - attempting to follow her stare. The antique/old fashioned feel is tremendous. Nice work!</td>', 'I guess I wasn''t around during this challenge.. and unfortunately missed this shot. Very well done, love the look on the child''s face and especially in her eyes. the tight crop gives the impression of very little space inside the trunk, and makes the viewer wonder what is beyond - attempting to follow her stare. The antique/old fashioned feel is tremendous. Nice work!', '2004-01-30 19:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
